Keeps this directory in the repo while the library is empty.

garage_console.pretty is registered in fp-lib-table as ${KIPRJMOD}/garage_console.pretty.
Git does not track empty directories, so without this file a fresh clone would leave
KiCad pointing the garage_console nickname at a path that does not exist.

KiCad only loads *.kicad_mod from a .pretty directory, so this file is ignored by the
footprint library loader. Delete it once the library holds a real footprint.
